=== PARITY (web source reproduced end-to-end) ===
  The web component is a thin, display-only wrapper around the shared <Lightbox>: with no
  photos it renders a friendly empty card (NOT a blank box); with photos a responsive grid
  of square thumbnails (grid-cols-2 sm:3 md:4), each a button opening the lightbox at its
  index. Reproduced:
  - Data source (web useTranslation + the `photos`/`vehicleName` props): bound through the
    P1/S8 seam VehiclePhotoSource→VehiclePhotoGalleryModel. No HTTP in the view; the
    prop-driven convenience init mirrors `<VehiclePhotoGallery photos vehicleName />`.
  - Composition:
      • empty card  -> dashed glass card + photo glyph + "No photos uploaded yet." +
                       "Photos uploaded for this vehicle will appear here."
      • grid        -> LazyVGrid(adaptive) of square AsyncImage thumbnails (object-cover),
                       each a Button opening the viewer (web handleOpen(i)).
      • <Lightbox>  -> a self-contained immersive viewer (the atomic shared Lightbox is the
                       P4 component-library prompt's deliverable; until it lands this surface
                       ships a complete viewer in its own files): paged nav (←/→, swipe,
                       Home/End), 1×–5× zoom in 0.5× steps (＋/－/0 + pinch) w/ drag-to-pan,
                       "n / total" counter, optional caption, Esc / backdrop-tap close.
                       Navigation resets zoom+pan (web useEffect(...,[index])).
  - States (ALL rendered; each has a #if DEBUG preview + a unit test):
      loading (skeleton grid) · empty (web placeholder branch) · error (message + Retry) ·
      data (grid + viewer) · stale (freshness chip + "Reconnecting — photos may be out of
      date" banner + one-shot auto-refresh) · offline (cached grid kept + "Offline — showing
      cached photos" banner + offline chip, no auto-refresh).
  - i18n (P1/S10): the 5 web keys preserved VERBATIM — vehicles.photos.empty / .emptyHelp /
      .galleryNamed ("{{name}} photo gallery") / .gallery / .openAt ("Open photo {{index}} of
      {{total}}"); native chrome + viewer keys namespaced vehicles.photos.* / .viewer.*.
      Referenced==declared verified: 22 code keys, 22 catalog keys, 0 undeclared. NO English
      string literals in native code (all via VehiclePhotoStrings + Text(verbatim:)).
  - Accessibility: VoiceOver labels on every interactive element — thumbnail buttons
      ("Open photo i of total" + alt as value), close/prev/next/zoom buttons, freshness chip,
      refresh, viewer counter; grid carries the named/unnamed gallery label; viewer is
      .isModal; Dynamic-Type system fonts (Font.TS); reduce-motion honored (press scale,
      zoom/index animations, key-nav).
  - Telemetry (P1/S11): VehiclePhotoGalleryModel.start() emits view.opened with surface slug
      "VehiclePhotoGallery" exactly once (OSLogVehiclePhotoTelemetry default; prod app injects
      the shared diagnostics adapter).

